"your Bill.<br>After all, life is beautiful and the time you have in hand should be "
"spent to enjoy it!<br>So here are our little ways to help you get more time for life!"
" &lt;/p&gt;\n"
"\n"
"&lt;a href=\"{{ payment_url }}\"&gt; click here to pay &lt;/a&gt;\n"
"\n"
"</pre>\n"
